[{"title":"农父 其二","author":"刘敞","text":"鸟飞不远，暮还其宅。\n我独匪人，去从兵籍。\n释弃耒耜，顾贪朝夕。\n转徙异方，终世为客。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40073,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"农哀","author":"刘敞","text":"阴阳失常度，水旱互为灾。\n岁暮不成耕，闾里自相哀。\n相哀竟何奈，田亩弃污莱。\n欲行关租急，欲居兵赋催。\n同知罗忧患，谁复念婴孩。\n往往遗渠沟，顾之泪如颓。\n国庾须积粟，国帑须羡财。\n大臣职富国，尔命自宜哉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40074,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠别长安妓蔡娇","author":"刘敞","text":"玳筵银烛彻宵明，白玉佳人唱渭城。\n更尽一杯须起舞，关河秋月不胜情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40075,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿乌沙","author":"刘敞","text":"朝离巴陵岸，暮投乌沙汀。\n大江屡回环，反顾犹洞庭。\n月色夺暗日，舟人各宵征。\n东南浮云际，极望都冥冥。\n不辨水与天，高低皆见星。\n分明银河流，来与江汉并。\n安得数尺槎，漂然向天庭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40076,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读列子赠几太博胜之殿丞君章监丞","author":"刘敞","text":"五岳穷云霓，沧海不可游。\n玉台焜朝日，珠华媚飞虬。\n飘飖群仙子，来往何其稠。\n咫尺视千里，俯仰移九秋。\n潮波有时起，势若空中浮。\n禺彊受帝命，巨鳌举其头。\n迩来百万祀，无复迁播忧。\n龙伯何为者，修干曳长钩。\n不知意谁憾，似与鳌为仇。\n六鳞既潜举，二山忽飘流。\n众真失其常，荡析不自谋。\n孰云飞升乐，奔迫良可愁。\n盈虚诚难必，藏壑有亡舟。\n至人纵大观，夷险固悠悠。\n如闻帝凭怒，侵减龙伯俦。\n且欲招群仙，复还故时丘。\n勉哉凌云迹，永谢北极幽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40077,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"回风馆","author":"刘敞","text":"殿翼翔空直，楼阴蔽日宽。\n风声弥玉宇，仙术废冰丸。\n老桧频成籁，相乌不定竿。\n世人惊未到，六月尚清寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40078,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"临都馆","author":"刘敞","text":"揽辔岁空尽，萧条万里间。\n向来貂已敝，此去鬓宜班。\n雪没前王帐，沙连右地山。\n星回阳气复，吾亦至几还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40079,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"张三馆有前岁赴举时题字处作 其一","author":"刘敞","text":"羁旅关东来献书，还曾题柱宿匡庐。\n自知不及相如健，重到曾无驾驷车。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40080,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"张三馆有前岁赴举时题字处作 其二","author":"刘敞","text":"暂怀印绶过家庭，车马骖驔去路轻。\n自为綵衣生意气，敢将昼锦比光荣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40081,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和张景纯初置馆中","author":"刘敞","text":"张也湖海士，心与迹并真。\n语默或不常，时以为狂人。\n蹉跎太仓史，奔走京华尘。\n颇如丧家狗，累累敝精神。\n虽游公卿间，望绝要路津。\n感激自上书，生当致青云。\n天光回日月，圣泽熙阳春。\n禁林给笔札，中府紬典坟。\n群玉连帝居，东壁临北辰。\n飞腾怪清切，寓直怀珍群。\n慷慨气益遒，咏歌思逾新。\n昔贤稽古力，利禄不足云。\n登瀛以为荣，襆被宁厌频。\n君乃鸾凤姿，方当极逢辰。\n岂若杨执戟，白头专校文。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40082,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"松子岭","author":"刘敞","text":"鹿儿峡未尽，松子岭相望。\n走险暇扫荫，摩空愁乱行。\n霜增头皓白，尘变马晒黄。\n不作还乡意，羁人应断肠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40083,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"壶公祠大树","author":"刘敞","text":"壶公飞升向千岁，兹树悬壶今尚在。\n繁根郁屈蟠蛟龙，冗干呺嚎作天籁。\n樛枝入土又旁出，四面童童若车盖。\n大钧播物信容易，父老相传谩惊骇。\n孔明庙前千丈柏，老子庭中左纽桧。\n天资正直本当寿，地养坚强自宜大。\n嗟尔朽质名弗闻，虽能所生世何赖。\n雷霆不及斤斧遗，但恐狐狸假为怪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40084,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和尚叔父病目","author":"刘敞","text":"恸器论时事，幽居祇杜门。\n自然忧未弭，那不眼潜昏。\n火齐终无颣，泉沙暂有浑。\n谁资上池水，洞视一方垣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40085,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚晴小园","author":"刘敞","text":"野客幽居何处寻，小园荒径似山林。\n雨足虾蟆何自喜，秋来蟋蟀竞悲吟。\n丹青果实同时熟，红白荷花相映深。\n可怨幽兰老堂下，无端柔蔓上城阴。\n微茫返照楼头出，萧索孤烟天际沉。\n楚泽偏伤千里目，西风自觉倦登临。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40086,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"伏日寻邻几不见","author":"刘敞","text":"朝日出东北，青云散朱晖。\n坚金为之铄，信此庚气微。\n吾子善闭关，今何冒炎威。\n流汗正被面，飞尘常满衣。\n忆君若冰雪，无以慰渴饥。\n伏日万鬼行，至如早旋归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40087,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"诗一首","author":"刘敞","text":"菩萨号文殊，禅堂名曲讲。\n语默本同源，名实不相愯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40088,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"种麦","author":"刘敞","text":"禹稷躬稼穑，春秋重麦禾。\n劝耕聊及暇，称力焉俟多。\n霜风虽凄紧，日晏更清和。\n轻裘颇自姿，扶杖勤来过。\n青青已布陇，芃芃在伐柯。\n农功欣嗣岁，节物嗟腾波。\n怅然念归田，自顾将婆娑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40089,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"葵花","author":"刘敞","text":"白露清风催八月，紫兰红叶共凄凉。\n黄花冷淡无人看，独自倾心向太阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40090,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"五色菊","author":"刘敞","text":"屡闻白雪题诗句，饱见黄花泛酒杯。\n岂是一枝能五色，相随次第雪中开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40091,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"行吟三清墀中示雷生","author":"刘敞","text":"翠柏高松雨后新，薄寒初起地无尘。\n自披鹤氅吟诗句，何必神仙更有人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40092,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上书行","author":"刘攽","text":"仕不至二千石，贾不至五百万。\n此事夸者忧，而非志士叹。\n君不见下邳少年授书起，幄中运筹制千里。\n功成不受三万户，拂衣归从赤松子。\n君不见计倪半策诛强吴，鸱夷扁舟浮五湖。\n三致千金不自擅，至今籍籍宗陶朱。\n大贤富贵不为己，心事邈与常人殊。\n逢时致身如反手，云蒸龙变无时无。\n君勿爱上书献赋称贤豪，刺绣倚市相矜高。\n丈夫昔曾笑徒劳，商贾旦旦争锥刀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40093,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"集曲水台","author":"刘敞","text":"羽觞泛中流，坐傍修竹里。\n右军期不来，白鸥自飞起。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40094,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"刘敞","text":"因君古人风，更欲投吾簪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40095,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"刘敞","text":"江色明吴甸，山香落楚梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40096,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四","author":"刘敞","text":"倾家酿酒经年醉，不使春风负玉壶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40097,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其五","author":"刘敞","text":"强挽春风留一醉，露香还可析朝酲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40098,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其六","author":"刘敞","text":"城角日高人寂寞，小庭行遍拾桐花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40099,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其七","author":"刘敞","text":"深林幽寂秋雨晦，丛兰猗猗无所佩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40100,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其八","author":"刘敞","text":"薰风四月浓芳歇，火玉烧枝拂露华。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40101,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其九","author":"刘敞","text":"南宾佳实传名久，曾忆巴山寄楚人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40102,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十","author":"刘敞","text":"颂声骚客误，锡贡禹书迟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40103,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十一","author":"刘敞","text":"江南碧木映霜秋，丹实清香破客愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40104,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十二","author":"刘敞","text":"不识日高眠起处，何如风定舞馀时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40105,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十三","author":"刘敞","text":"南墙双柏天生直，材虽未老心千尺。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40106,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十四","author":"刘敞","text":"美田钩盾里，躬稼麦秋馀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40107,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十六","author":"刘敞","text":"廉吏今无刿，仁人古戒磏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40108,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十七","author":"刘敞","text":"世乱颍水浊，世治颍水清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40109,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十八","author":"刘敞","text":"说文黄葵常倾叶，向日不令照其根。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40110,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送富郎中守苏州","author":"王圭","text":"绿绨传诏下天畿，驿驭骎骎拥使騑。\n境上人瞻司马节，里中昼耀买臣衣。\n宾帷华履侵宵会，农野朱轓带雨归。\n方有壮图深许国，庾园无计恋芳菲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40111,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寿春花 其一","author":"王圭","text":"华省当时绿鬓郎，金樽美酒醉红芳。\n今日对花不成饮，春愁已与草俱长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40112,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"端午内中帖子词 其三 太上皇后阁","author":"王圭","text":"仙艾垂门绿，灵丝绕户长。\n何人握彤筦，金殿纪多祥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40113,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其三十二","author":"王圭","text":"内家宣赐生辰宴，隔夜诸宫进御花。\n后殿未闻公主入，东门先报下金车。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40114,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其三十三","author":"王圭","text":"端午生衣进御床，赭黄罗帕覆金箱。\n美人捧入南薰殿，玉腕斜封綵缕长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40115,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其三十四","author":"王圭","text":"选进仙韶第一人，才胜罗绮不胜春。\n重教按舞桃花下，只踏残红作地裀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40116,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其三十五","author":"王圭","text":"侍女争挥玉弹弓，金丸飞入乱花中。\n一时惊起流莺散，踏落残英满地红。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40117,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其三十六","author":"王圭","text":"七宝栏干白玉除，新开凉殿幸金舆。\n一沟泛碧流春水，四面琼钩搭绮疏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40118,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其三十七","author":"王圭","text":"山楼彩凤栖寒月，宴殿金麟吐御香。\n蜀锦地衣呈队舞，教头先出拜君王。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40119,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其三十八","author":"王圭","text":"天外明河翻玉浪，楼西凉月涌金盆。\n香销甲乙床前帐，宫锁玲珑闭殿门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40120,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其三十九","author":"王圭","text":"西风攲叶撼宫梧，早怯秋寒着绣襦。\n玉宇无人双燕去，一弯新月上金枢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40121,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其四十","author":"王圭","text":"夜寒金屋篆烟飞，灯烛分明在紫微。\n漏永禁宫三十六，燕回争踏月轮归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40122,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其四十一","author":"王圭","text":"晓吹翩翩动翠旂，炉烟千叠瑞云飞。\n何人奏对偏移刻，御史天香隔绣衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40123,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其四十二","author":"王圭","text":"金井秋啼络纬声，出花宫漏报严更。\n不知谁是金銮直，玉宇沉沉夜气清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40124,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其四十三","author":"王圭","text":"内庭秋燕玉池东，香散荷花水殿风。\n阿监采菱牵锦缆，月明犹在画船中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40125,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其四十四","author":"王圭","text":"东宫花烛綵楼新，天上仙桥不锁春。\n遍出六宫歌舞奏，姮娥初到月虚轮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40126,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其四十五","author":"王圭","text":"纱幔薄垂金麦穗，帘钩纤挂玉葱条。\n楼西别起长春殿，香壁红泥透蜀椒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40127,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其四十六","author":"王圭","text":"翠华香重玉炉添，双凤楼头晓日暹。\n扇掩红鸾金殿悄，一声清跸捲珠帘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40128,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其四十七","author":"王圭","text":"金作盘龙绣作鳞，壶冰楼阁禁中春。\n君王避暑来游幸，风月横秋气象新。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40129,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其四十八","author":"王圭","text":"清晓自倾花上露，冷侵宫殿玉蟾蜍。\n擘开五色销金纸，碧琐琐前学草书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40130,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其四十九","author":"王圭","text":"翠钿帖靥轻如笑，玉凤雕钗袅欲飞。\n拂晓贺春皇帝阁，綵衣金胜近龙衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40131,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其五十","author":"王圭","text":"琐声金掣阁门环，帘捲真珠十二间。\n别殿春风呼万岁，中丞新押散朝班。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40132,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其五十一","author":"王圭","text":"鸡人报晓传三唱，玉井金床转辘轳。\n烟引御炉香绕殿，漏签初刻上铜壶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40133,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其五十二","author":"王圭","text":"御案横金殿幄红，扇开云表露天容。\n太常奏备三千曲，乐府新调十二钟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40134,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其五十三","author":"王圭","text":"宫女薰香进御衣，殿门开锁请金匙。\n朝阳初上黄金屋，禁掖春深昼漏迟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40135,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其五十四","author":"王圭","text":"三月金明柳絮飞，岸花堤草弄春时。\n楼船百戏催宣赐，御辇今年不上池。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40136,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其五十五","author":"王圭","text":"内人稀见水鞦韆，争擘珠帘障殿前。\n第一锦标谁夺得，右军输却小龙船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40137,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其五十六","author":"王圭","text":"夜色楼台月数层，金猊烟穗绕觚棱。\n重廊屈折连三殿，密上真珠百宝灯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40138,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其五十七","author":"王圭","text":"天门晏闭九重关，楼倚银河气象閒。\n一点星球垂绛阙，五云仙仗下蓬山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40139,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其五十八","author":"王圭","text":"禁里春浓蝶自飞，御蚕眠处弄新丝。\n碧琐尽日教鹦鹉，念得君王数首诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40140,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其五十九","author":"王圭","text":"斗草深宫玉槛前，青蒲如箭荇如钱。\n不知红药栏干曲，日暮何人落翠钿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40141,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其六十","author":"王圭","text":"太液波清水殿凉，画船惊起宿鸳鸯。\n翠眉不及池边柳，取次飞花入建章。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40142,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其六十一","author":"王圭","text":"御座垂帘绣额单，冰山重叠贮金盘。\n玉清迢递无尘到，殿角东西五月寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40143,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其六十二","author":"王圭","text":"春心滴破花边露，晓梦敲回禁里钟。\n十二楚山何处是，御楼曾见两三峰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40144,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其六十三","author":"王圭","text":"博山夜宿沉香火，帐外时闻暖凤笙。\n理遍从头新上曲，殿前宠直未交更。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40145,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其六十四","author":"王圭","text":"春殿千官宴喜归，上林莺舌报花时。\n宣徽旋进新裁曲，学士争吟应诏诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40146,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其六十五","author":"王圭","text":"钓线沉波漾綵舟，鱼争芳饵上龙钩。\n内人急捧金盘接，拨剌红鳞跃未休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40147,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]